1
00:00:03,191 --> 00:00:09,836
Open Interaction Center, Management, Subject Flows, and click Manage Flow next to the subject.

2
00:00:09,836 --> 00:00:11,564
A new flow is empty.

3
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:14,355
Click Add Action, and pick the type:

4
00:00:14,355 --> 00:00:19,871
Finish, Try Again, New Activity, or Convert Lead, which appears with the CRM.

5
00:00:20,322 --> 00:00:23,942
Finish completes the activity and nothing else happens.

6
00:00:23,942 --> 00:00:27,680
Pick the disposition it responds to, here Not Interested.

7
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:32,901
When to choose this disposition is guidance the AI reads when it picks an outcome.

8
00:00:32,901 --> 00:00:36,046
It starts as the disposition's own description.

9
00:00:36,046 --> 00:00:41,267
Show communication preferences lets the action flag the contact, here Do not call,

10
00:00:41,267 --> 00:00:44,175
and with the CRM, set the status of a lead.

11
00:00:44,175 --> 00:00:45,302
Click Create.

